"F City, often just 'F', fills most of Anesidora's larger, circular southern island."
"F City is home to a few million people and to the island's lower-rank schools."
"Arrival Station F, the Teleportation Complex, is where most visitors land in F City."
"A duck park with swings, a small fish pond and a duck-food gumball machine is near the complex."
"Post Drop #1301, a talking mailbox gifted by the Wright Indah Juliana, is at Arrival Station F."
"Rosa Grove Mall is in F City."
"An all-inclusive F City apartment complex costs almost a million a year."
"F City isn't sorted by rank or class; people cluster by lifestyle, unlike more sorted Apex."
"Its air is busy with delivery drones, and city buses run through it."
"Rosa Grove Mall is the largest shopping center on the island, with hundreds of stores."
"F City's northern edge has an open-air market signed in Chinese characters and Cyrillic."
"An open food court there overlooks the water and the bridge to Apex."
"The intake complex for new Avowed teens is on F City's south shore."
"F City's general high schools teach some Avowed culture but no power development."
"The Nautilus Needle crowns an F City district with a silver spire and visible helix shields."
"F City's mansion district has lawns, mini forests and sports fields around artificial hills."
"The island's largest racetrack is in the mansion district."
"The Miracle Lakes neighborhoods are twee, with decorative ponds and themed housing."
"Milagro Lakeside Village and koi-filled Kiseki Lake are Miracle Lakes neighborhoods."
"An open-air market uses wind shielding and deeply recessed stalls beside a crashing seawall."
"The Pandora Anthropodrome is the big earthen track in F City where Brutes race."
"A rooftop-to-rooftop coaster runs over F City on an invisible track with molding seats."
"The coaster's boarding building has shops for paper, art supplies and fast fashion."
"Rosa Grove Mall's third-floor Filipino restaurant overlooks a lit fountain; a food hall is below."
"Manon Barre lived in an apartment near the Nautilus Needle."
